.TH WAIT_NOINTR 3
.SH NAME
wait_nointr \- wait for a child process, restarting on interrupt
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "wait.h"
.PP
.BI "int wait_nointr(int* " wstat ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wait_nointr
waits for any child process to terminate. If the system call is interrupted
by a signal (EINTR), it automatically restarts the wait call.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the PID of the terminated child, or -1 on error.